# Scope finding for the app's tree, judged against this plan's app steps (the stage removal, the colour given back through the look's own mapping, the record, notes, checks and walks, and the first send of the walk-settling step), its Files list, and the owner's messages as the check prints them.
# 
# What the diff holds: sixteen modified tracked files, nothing staged, no untracked file, and no commit on top of staging's head. Every path is inside the plan's app Files list: five files under the source folder (the renderer, the editor page's code, the CPU pipeline, the preview cache constant and the sky selection builder), five decision records, the generated module map, the notes, the preview-version stamp, and three tools (the accessibility walk, the Aerochrome walk and the decisions check). The plan lists the infrared science file and three allow-lists as places it may touch; this diff leaves all four alone. Nothing outside the list differs: no hub file, no workflow, no hook, no version file, no new file at the repository root.
